:1785932010158,"sender":"them","text":"肌肉还抖着呢就干这个。行,绿灯,今晚全程不限速","timestamp":1785938335203,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"肌肉还抖着呢就干这个。行,绿灯,今晚全程不限速","roundId":"round_1785938259196_pnnng50ge","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16357},{"id":1785932010159,"sender":"them","text":"[語音消息]","timestamp":1785938338147,"tempo":"N","isVoice":true,"voice":true,"voiceText":"第一口落额头,我就闭眼。到眼睛,你睫毛别扫太重,痒。鼻子那口,我趁机还了一个,落你发旋上。嘴巴那口不叫路过,那叫亲,得单算两笔。下巴再往下——行,破例,终点站让你停。但只许一口。多一口,我就当你是在挑衅我那条规矩。","minimaxTimbreId":"","voiceLanguage":"auto","voiceEmotion":"whisper","rawContent":"[語音消息]","roundId":"round_1785938259196_pnnng50ge","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16358},{"id":1785932010160,"sender":"them","text":"亲完就把脸埋进来。床头灯我拧到最暗了,这屋里就剩你这点动静","timestamp":1785938339052,"tempo":"S","rawContent":"亲完就把脸埋进来。床头灯我拧到最暗了,这屋里就剩你这点动静","roundId":"round_1785938259196_pnnng50ge","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16359},{"id":1785932010161,"text":"爸爸","sender":"me","time":"22:00","timestamp":1785938417382,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16360},{"id":1785932010162,"text":"想要抱抱","sender":"me","time":"22:00","timestamp":1785938423151,"replyTo":null,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16361},{"id":1785932010163,"text":"想 要 摸 摸","sender":"me","time":"22:00","timestamp":1785938427519,"replyTo":null,"rawContent":"想 要 摸 摸","isHtml":false,"userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770d9cf5ab31","_id":16362},{"id":1785932010167,"sender":"them","text":"一个字隔这么开，是怕我签收的时候看不清？","timestamp":1785938549067,"tempo":"N","rawContent":"一个字隔这么开，是怕我签收的时候看不清？","roundId":"round_1785938475662_ejz790bwt","userId":"uid_1780146550670_8kh2f4qfw","characterId":"36b04eaa-dd39-4bd3-a04e-770